  "verdict": "at llo1: every forecast lead fails the ADR-006 bar AT THIS NODE \u2014 but the site check refuses to generalise it (the model is further from satellite (+3.9 C) than the observation is (-1.1 C) \u2014 the model is locally wrong here, so results measure this node and must not be generalised to the product)",
